        <mxCell id="albNote" value="Target type &lt;b&gt;ip&lt;/b&gt; &#8212; task ENIs registered directly, no instance hop&lt;br&gt;Health check: GET / every 15s, timeout 5s, 2 healthy / 3 unhealthy, expect 200&lt;br&gt;ALB SG: ingress :80 from 0.0.0.0/0&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Listener starts on blue; CodeDeploy owns the swap thereafter&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#B0B7C3;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=8;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
